OL,3,GNEWSADebris cleared from race day burst
OL,4,Apipe flood
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 200 tonnes of debris has been
OL,7,Fcleared from a road which flooded when
OL,8,Fa large water pipe burst, disrupting
OL,9,Ftraffic heading to the Great North Run.
OL,11,FNorthumbrian Water said there was a
OL,12,F"heavy burst on a water main" on the
OL,13,Fgrass bank at the side of Askew Road in
OL,14,FGateshead, which saw mud, rocks and
OL,15,Fwater cascade down to the roundabout
OL,16,Funder the southern approach to the A189
OL,17,FRedheugh Bridge on Sunday.
OL,19,FThe road was shut just as thousands of
OL,20,Fpeople were making their way to the
OL,21,Fannual half-marathon that crosses the
OL,22,Fnearby Tyne Bridge.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
